{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-worker/vfs/tests/adversarial.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-22T12:23:14.455924Z","id":"48442d2ce8f0b38167e964021a3656024ef903abdb94900751a0760eb10352d0","body":{"detail":"Seen under just worker-test (cargo test -q --workspace in crates/clax-worker, machine load ~20) at line 215, the second-connection open on an open file; three reruns of cargo test -p clax-do-vfs --test adversarial passed. The panic is in the VFS registry's RefCell, reached reentrantly or across the test harness's threads; a panic there cannot unwind (panic in a function that cannot unwind), so it aborts every test in the binary.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":201},"end":{"line":215},"content_hash":"b7b97ad8f835ff2c95bec8c23a7e03a9c2a106225e85d55be977306fddf166da"},"summary":"only_the_files_open_registered_can_be_opened failed once in four runs: rsqlite-vfs 0.1.1 lib.rs:393 panicked 'RefCell already borrowed' inside an extern C callback, aborting the test binary","tags":["flaky","session:claude-code:7580ce1b-abf0-421d-8a2a-2be245f95865"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-worker/vfs/tests/adversarial.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-28T18:26:36.392689Z","id":"bbcc41ab50acd9fe2d563ccb91e1de5575df3e719cf767ad2ca63daf46fb1840","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:07fb4cce6","summary":"Fixed in 07fb4cce6: the panic is rsqlite-vfs's shared last-error RefCell (VfsAppData::store_err) borrowed from two test threads at once; each test in vfs/tests/adversarial.rs and vfs/tests/vfs.rs now holds a process-wide lock. cargo test -p clax-do-vfs --test adversarial failed 1 of 30 runs before ('RefCell already borrowed'), and --test adversarial --test vfs passes 100 of 100 after.","supersedes":"48442d2ce8f0b38167e964021a3656024ef903abdb94900751a0760eb10352d0","tags":["session:claude-code:082c8a2e-1d4f-4cb1-8f07-ecd7fd8e2ecf"]}}
